Implementation note for the builder
Before coding, identify the current repository/project and deployment setup. Return the Phase 0 outputs first, then proceed with a small vertical slice that can be demonstrated end to end (school setup → learner enrollment → attendance → grade/fee record → guardian view → report/export). Keep a decision log and flag any requirement that depends on Ministry documentation, a payment provider, or customer policy.
